netpanzer (0.9.0+fork1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fork build of netPanzer 0.9.0.
    - Ported to SDL3, SDL3_ttf and SDL3_mixer.
    - Lua 5.1.5 replaced by Lua 5.4.
    - Memory-safety fixes: server console spin, several null dereferences
      from malformed packets, an out-of-bounds BitArray allocation, an
      A* use of uninitialised members, and 70 uninitialised members
      including structs that go out on the wire.
    - Network input is now length-checked before it is cast, across all
      five message classes whose length the client router used to discard.
    - Frame path: the screen texture is no longer reallocated every frame,
      and only changed rows are converted and uploaded.

 -- packerlschupfer <helmut.adrigan@chello.at>  Sun, 09 Aug 2026 16:56:08 +0200
